// lib/mesh_exchange.cubalc — documented SMX EXCHANGE loop snippet
// INCLUDE after cubes peer0 + peer1 exist (placed, plugged, bits optional).
//
// Form: SMX EXCHANGE a b  ≡  SMX TALK a→b then b→a  (binary SMX2, no HTTP)
// Env:  CUBALC_SMX_KEY  (64-hex; demo key used if unset for local proof)
// Out:  SMX_OK · SMX_TALKS  (caller ASSERTs)

SMX KEY

// Round 1 — seed mutual matrix
SMX EXCHANGE peer0 peer1

// Round 2 — second pass keeps hive unity after further FOLDBITS/SETBIT
// (copy these lines or re-INCLUDE for more rounds)
SMX EXCHANGE peer0 peer1

// Agents: PRINT_JSON SMX_OK SMX_TALKS after INCLUDE to inspect
